# NRD and discordance is calculated as follows:
#   m .. number of matches
#   x .. number of mismatches
#   NRD = 100 * (xRR + xRA + xAA) / (xRR + xRA + xAA + mRA + mAA)
#   RR discordance = 100 * xRR / (xRR + mRR)
#   RA discordance = 100 * xRA / (xRA + mRA)
#   AA discordance = 100 * xAA / (xAA + mAA)
